{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202697IMT4HG921795618146.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國上月核心通脹稍高過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>美國個人消費開支物價指數PCE10月按年升百分之3.8，按月升幅維持於百分之0.3。兩個數據都符合市場預期。扣除食品和能源的核心個人消費開支物價指數PCE，10月按年升幅加快至百分之3.3，高過9月和市場預期。按月升幅則維持於百分之0.3，與市場預期和9月相同。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:43:56.314207+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:15:57.076215+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T15:37:17.327045+00:00","content_hash":"bebe9cc4d5b0399fdda7b5eec616811329cd988071cf5ade007a9b9cdeb6bc57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:43:56.314207+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}